+
+```bash
+PYTHONPATH=<llama.cpp>/gguf-py python tools/ik2_fp8_experts.py Inkling-2-Mini-UD-Q8_K_XL.gguf Inkling-2-Mini-UD-Q8_K_XL-maya-fp8.gguf
+```
+
+Only maya-ik2 can read the rewritten file. On a 24 GB A30 it fits with 16k context, 4 slots and the drafter (KV in FP16: leave `IK2_KV=fp8` out); the BF16 file fits entirely in VRAM only at a few thousand tokens of context. Layers 0 to 19 carry the same NVFP4 experts as `UD-Q4_K_XL`, and Q8 decodes more slowly.
 
